meta {
  name: Media
  type: http
  seq: 31
}

get {
  url: {{api}}/media/{{mediaId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  One of your own photos or voice notes: its kind, status, type and size. A photo is processed once it is complete (ADR-0048): PROCESSING, then READY or FAILED. Once READY, `url` is a signed GET of the larger WebP kept of it, valid for at least 24 hours and the same all hour, with its `width` and `height`; before, all three are null. Only its owner can read it; anyone else gets 404, as for an id that names nothing. Delete media deletes it, while it is on no entry.
}
